ationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:03:47.712Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"2439710","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2439710/","officialWebsite":null,"support":null},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":4,"unit":"GB","display":"4 GB","approximateBytes":4000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 4 GB"},"recommended":{"value":8,"unit":"GB","display":"8 GB","approximateBytes":8000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 8 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"2439710","steamName":"Skybreakers","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2439710/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:37:36.911729+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Skybreakers is an action roguelike thriller. Choose from various characters, arm yourself with a vast array of weapons, and create your own unique build by combining artifacts, random talents, abilities, and bonds. Plunge into exhilarating combat and use unique abilities to defeat the evil.","detailedDescription":"Join our discord\n\nAbout the Game\n∷ Indulge in fast-paced battles for an exhilarating combat experience.\n∷ Choose from four unique characters to transform your gameplay experience.\n∷ Craft varying battle experiences with 9 unique weapons tailored to each character.\n∷ Forge a distinctive build through a rich mix of character talents, abilities, and artifacts.\n∷ Enjoy the thrill of random weaon bonues and relentless reforging.\n∷ Use your custom builds to climb the difficulty levels and confront a variety of mysterious monsters and Bosses.\n\nStrategize with Weapons, Customize Your Combat Style\n\nThe game features four distinct characters, each with 9 different weapons that can alter their moves. With 3 advanced effects for each type of attack - Basic Attack, Dash, and Ultimate - you can unleash multiple levels of damage, teleportation, disruption, buffs, and more. Engage in proactive combat and enjoy exhilarating, fast-paced battles.\n\nForge Exclusive Builds, Elevate Your Gaming Fun\n\nCharacter weapons can create different play styles. Various systems such as talents, artifacts, random affixes, abilities, and bonds, allow you to create unique builds that greatly increase the replayability of the game. After a few rounds of exploration, you could be the next speedrun champion! Random weapon bonuses and map elements add to the variety of combat.\n\nEmbrace fantastical  Monster Designs, Face Higher Challenges\n\nSkybreakers immerses players in a captivating world a traditional ink-wash painting style. Players will gradually acquire resources and master various schools of secret arts to battle waves of evil creatures. Find your preferred fighting style, take on increasingly challenging levels, and experience a growing sense of excitement!","aboutGame":"∷ Indulge in fast-paced battles for an exhilarating combat experience.\n∷ Choose from four unique characters to transform your gameplay experience.\n∷ Craft varying battle experiences with 9 unique weapons tailored to each character.\n∷ Forge a distinctive build through a rich mix of character talents, abilities, and artifacts.\n∷ Enjoy the thrill of random weaon bonues and relentless reforging.\n∷ Use your custom builds to climb the difficulty levels and confront a variety of mysterious monsters and Bosses.\n\nStrategize with Weapons, Customize Your Combat Style\n\nThe game features four distinct characters, each with 9 different weapons that can alter their moves. With 3 advanced effects for each type of attack - Basic Attack, Dash, and Ultimate - you can unleash multiple levels of damage, teleportation, disruption, buffs, and more. Engage in proactive combat and enjoy exhilarating, fast-paced battles.\n\nForge Exclusive Builds, Elevate Your Gaming Fun\n\nCharacter weapons can create different play styles. Various systems such as talents, artifacts, random affixes, abilities, and bonds, allow you to create unique builds that greatly increase the replayability of the game. After a few rounds of exploration, you could be the next speedrun champion! Random weapon bonuses and map elements add to the variety of combat.\n\nEmbrace fantastical  Monster Designs, Face Higher Challenges\n\nSkybreakers immerses players in a captivating world a traditional ink-wash painting style. Players will gradually acquire resources and master various schools of secret arts to battle waves of evil creatures. Find your preferred fighting style, take on increasingly challenging levels, and experience a growing sense of excitement!"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439710/header.jpg?t=1727170517"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic